ould-have-given-them-ownership-of-the-road/articleshow/135087381.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-missouri-a-couple-bought-land-with-no-road-access-and-sought-a-40-foot-strip-through-their-neighbours-property-a-2026-appeals-court-reversed-the-ruling-that-would-have-given-them-ownership-of-the-road/articleshow/135087381.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-21T14:40:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135087456,imgsize-2141415.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nazi-looted Degas painting sparks $10.7 million inheritance battle decades later]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135086292.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-jewish-couples-art-collection-was-looted-by-the-nazis-in-1935-more-than-90-years-later-their-heirs-are-still-fighting-over-a-degas-painting-sold-for-10-7-million/articleshow/135086292.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-jewish-couples-art-collection-was-looted-by-the-nazis-in-1935-more-than-90-years-later-their-heirs-are-still-fighting-over-a-degas-painting-sold-for-10-7-million/articleshow/135086292.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-21T14:38:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135087508,imgsize-1127493.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Margot Robbie’s renovated Hollywood bungalow sold for $1.2 million]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135087224.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In February 2018, Margot Robbie bought a charming 945-square-foot bungalow in Hollywood Heights for $950,000. After giving it a stylish makeover, she rented it out at various rates. She eventually sold the property in 2021 for around $1.2 million, marking a profitable investment. This venture underscores the appeal of smaller homes in attractive neighborhoods, complementing her extensive property collection across Los Angeles and Australia.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-2018-margot-robbie-bought-a-945-square-foot-hollywood-bungalow-for-950000-and-renovated-it-before-offering-it-for-rent-at-4200-a-month-three-years-later-the-tiny-home-sold-for-around-1-2-million/articleshow/135087224.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-2018-margot-robbie-bought-a-945-square-foot-hollywood-bungalow-for-950000-and-renovated-it-before-offering-it-for-rent-at-4200-a-month-three-years-later-the-tiny-home-sold-for-around-1-2-million/articleshow/135087224.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-21T14:37:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135087504,imgsize-182694.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Wetland restoration boosts Spain’s marbled ducks to 172 breeding females in 2025]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135086169.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/spain-recorded-172-breeding-female-marbled-ducks-and-1427-chicks-in-2025-up-from-just-20-breeding-pairs-in-2009-after-a-conservation-project-restored-more-than-3600-hectares-of-wetlands/articleshow/135086169.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/spain-recorded-172-breeding-female-marbled-ducks-and-1427-chicks-in-2025-up-from-just-20-breeding-pairs-in-2009-after-a-conservation-project-restored-more-than-3600-hectares-of-wetlands/articleshow/135086169.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-21T13:29:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135086201,imgsize-208306.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meloni toughens protest laws: Teen detentions, parental liability, 5-year jail term]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135086043.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In response to recent disturbances, Italian Prime Minister Giorgia Meloni has introduced stringent security measures aimed at curbing protest-related violence. These measures entail prison sentences, fines, and even financial repercussions for parents of minors who participate in illegal protests. Authorities now have increased powers to detain youths perceived as threats, irrespective of actual criminal acts.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/italys-meloni-toughens-protest-laws-teen-detentions-parental-liability-5-year-jail-term/articleshow/135086043.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/italys-meloni-toughens-protest-laws-teen-detentions-parental-liability-5-year-jail-term/articleshow/135086043.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-21T13:31:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135086215,imgsize-59174.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Missouri court upholds revival of $220,000 judgment after appeal deadline is missed]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135085756.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Diane Longsdon encounters a significant legal hurdle as an appeals court dismisses her bid to contest a $220,000 repayment order. The issue originated from modifications to a family trust created by Violet M. Steinert and her spouse in 1994. Although Longsdon initially received money from these alterations, a court later upheld the original trust's validity.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-missouri-widow-changed-a-family-trust-and-a-later-amendment-gave-220000-to-a-beneficiary-after-a-court-ordered-repayment-an-october-20-ruling-dismissed-her-appeal-as-too-late/articleshow/135085756.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-missouri-widow-changed-a-family-trust-and-a-later-amendment-gave-220000-to-a-beneficiary-after-a-court-ordered-repayment-an-october-20-ruling-dismissed-her-appeal-as-too-late/articleshow/135085756.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-21T13:27:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135086011,imgsize-1505421.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[She revived her boyfriend twice after they were struck by lightning; a year later, they are married]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135084883.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[During a hiking trip, Eva Broderick's quick thinking saved her boyfriend Nick's life after they were both struck by lightning. Stranded in an isolated area, they faced delays as rescuers searched for them without precise location data. After their recovery, Nick's heartfelt proposal led to their wedding nearly a year later in August. Eva's heroic actions highlight the life-saving potential of CPR knowledge in unpredictable outdoor situations.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2025-a-wisconsin-hiking-couple-were-struck-by-lightning-and-eva-revived-nick-twice-during-a-50-minute-rescue-wait-a-year-later-they-are-married-and-she-is-due-to-receive-a-lifesaving-award/articleshow/135084883.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2025-a-wisconsin-hiking-couple-were-struck-by-lightning-and-eva-revived-nick-twice-during-a-50-minute-rescue-wait-a-year-later-they-are-married-and-she-is-due-to-receive-a-lifesaving-award/articleshow/135084883.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-21T13:26:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135084987,imgsize-1397291.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[England rugby legend Lawrence Dallaglio’s World Cup medal sells for £54,000]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135083244.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[An exciting auction spotlighted an array of sports memorabilia, notably sounding the sale of Lawrence Dallaglio's silver-gilt medal from the 2003 Rugby World Cup, fetching £54,000. Collectors clamored for not only this remarkable piece but also his British and Irish Lions cap. Further captivating bids were made on football items, including Eric Cantona's iconic shorts and a BBC World Cup table, showcasing the rising allure of sports collectibles.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/england-rugby-legend-lawrence-dallaglios-world-cup-medal-sells-for-54000-eric-cantonas-shorts-go-under-the-hammer/articleshow/135083244.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/england-rugby-legend-lawrence-dallaglios-world-cup-medal-sells-for-54000-eric-cantonas-shorts-go-under-the-hammer/articleshow/135083244.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-21T13:26:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elemen